chapter.v:
“Come to 


Bethel, and, 


transgress; to Gilgal, and multiply transgression; bring your sacrifices every morning, your tithes every three days;

“I also 


withheld the, 


rain from you when there were yet three months to the harvest; I would send rain on one city, and send no rain on another city; one field would have rain, and the field on which it did not rain would wither;
